{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw bombs and charge ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this stage-clearing action game packed with respect for 80\u2019s arcades, rescue the lady imprisoned in the factory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero is a cute yet tough bipedal cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride the nostalgic tones of the 1980s as you infiltrate a dangerous bomb factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage is filled with unique gimmicks that will test your judgment and action skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy four computer terminals with the bombs placed around the stage to disable the barrier \u2014 then deliver the finishing blow to the boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rest assured \u2014 the controls and speed are tuned to 21st-century standards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a fresh bomb-throwing action experience that fuses retro visuals with modern gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3923130?t=1755816743","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3923130?t=1755816743","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923130/c78a987aabd50582c56794476e49914280d5ece2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755816743","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923130/c78a987aabd50582c56794476e49914280d5ece2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755816743","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw bombs and charge ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In t